TI  - Thoracoscopy: a real-life perspective.
PG  - 93-8
LID - S0272-5231(12)00127-X [pii]
LID - 10.1016/j.ccm.2012.12.002 [doi]
AB  - This article focuses on thoracoscopy for pleural procedures, both diagnostic and 
      therapeutic, and discusses whether there is a difference between pleuroscopy and 
      thoracoscopy or video-assisted thoracic surgery. How thinking should be 
      structured regarding the management of pleural disease in the modern context of 
      available approaches and interventions is also discussed.
