TI  - Spontaneous pneumothorax and alpha 1-antitrypsin deficiency.
PG  - 327-9
AB  - Spontaneous pneumothorax has been observed in patients with abnormal levels of 
      alpha 1-antitrypsin. We report the case of a young woman with a low level of 
      alpha 1-antitrypsin who presented with recurrent episodes of spontaneous 
      pneumothorax and who required pleuroscopy, apical lung resection, and 
      pleurodesis.
